  "actual_object_invariants": [
    "selectedWCells is selectedCells filtered by actual boxPolicy(gridBox n J)=wPolicy; it is not an arbitrary compatible W family.",
    "ordinaryTuples is the original jointSelector N E filtered by nonzero tupleTag. ownerBox and selectedPolicy are the original geometric owner and policy.",
    "jointPresievedSigma is OriginalJointPresievedCompiler.jointPresievedSigma, the explicitly constructed all16 common-beta coefficient, not the old all-prime native sigma.",
    "canonicalSlots uses the same physical target N, cap ceil(Z(atomOwner key,eta,N)), w=N^(nu0*epsilon^2) and same Z. beta e attaches only to right group; a*b*c=fullPrefix t*r.",
    "atomGroups is the original real-endpoint wGroups on one padded owner corner and one fixed rough fine-cell upper vector. It may depend on N and HB query A, but not on an arithmetic tuple or discrepancy sign after the key is fixed.",
    "The HB test Group list is separate from the selected coefficient mark t. The local x floor uses its original blocks and grouped complement; no t-word substitution.",
    "The selected-W branch keeps physical N and its original cap. The independent singleton root's separate cap2N cutoff application does not relabel this branch's N."
  ],
