    "consumer_order": "exists max(2,N1), forall N above it, then E,t,ht,hW,r,hr,hq,gs,rank/trim evidence,left/right/b,U; no mark-specific N0",
    "payment_derivation": "ellMax<=cellDelta/2 and z<=ellMax/512 give 1024*z<=cellDelta. Existing W_eventual_local_scale_payments supplies the comparisons. Finset.sup collects per-owner thresholds.",
    "atom_budget": "WAtomKey finite depends on fixed n,eta,nu0,epsilon; roughMeshPrecision is independent of N and marks."
  },
